<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Souza Cruz Jan-Sept net lower.</title>
<headline>Brazil Souza Cruz Jan-Sept net lower.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian cigarette maker Souza Cruz issued the following statement on its results in the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>			     Jan-Sept 1996	     Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p> Net profit		   142.2 million		   189 million</p>
<p> Profit per share	   0.47			  0.62</p>
<p> Gross revenue		4.412 bln		   3.685 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Adjusted for inflation, Souza Cruz's net profit was 83 million reais against 133 million reais in January to September 1995, Souza Cruz said.</p>
</text>
